We are very pleased to announce the launch of The Chess Variants Club!

Play and discover 10 popular chess variants, improve your chess skills with hundreds of chess puzzles, or simply play regular chess with your friends - all in one package. 

This diverse collection includes several chess games and puzzles that will entertain you and your friends for thousands of hours. All in a minimalist, beautifully designed virtual chess club.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/37117656/9925308ce068a3e343ac02658b7e687da317793b.jpg[/img]

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/37117656/14a9c362ae823a385d1f224523da4fde26169a53.jpg[/img]

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/37117656/e033993f3967f7fe9f3ca3cbe6ca41fa92dd7ca7.jpg[/img]

Here is the list of Chess Variants currently available (more to come soon):

[list]
[*] Demi-Chess;
[*] Dunsany's Chess;
[*] Chess960 (Fischer Random Chess);
[*] Los Alamos Chess;
[*] Atomic Chess;
[*] Silverman Chess;
[*] Microchess;
[*] Diana chess;
[*] Circe Chess;
[*] Dunsany's Chess;
[*] 3-Checks Chess;
[/list]

You can get it right now with a sweet discounted price and play it for thousands of hours:

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1292240/The_Chess_Variants_Club/

Have fun!

Hi,
It's been great to have people playing and enjoying Mini Words!
Based on community feedback we are releasing an update containing bug fixes and some improvements including:
- Some reviewed word definitions; 
- Achievement fixes, including All Words No Tips (for completing No tips mode) and excluding currently unused ones;
- Level menu navigation;
- Frame rate adjustment.
Thanks everyone for the feedback and support!
